  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "In your `RealtimeResponseBody` real-time response, you can choose from mutually exclusive options. Include `alternateProduct` in your response to provide a switch-plan retention message.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/RealtimeResponseBody"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Use the product identifier in `DecodedRealtimeRequestBody` to determine the customer’s current subscription. Choose an alternative subscription from the same subscription group.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/DecodedRealtimeRequestBody"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The message identifier needs to refer to a message that doesn’t include an image and that has a `messageState` of `APPROVED`; otherwise, the retention message fails. For more information about setting up messages, see `Upload-Message`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/messageState",
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Upload-Message"
          ]
        }
      ],
